384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (The project also provides an opportunity to apply advanced cross-platform mobile development knowledge using Flutter and Firebase in a real-world commerce context, bridging frontend design, backend security, and database management into a cohesive deployable product. Nutonium serves as a comprehensive learning platform that integrates mobile development, cloud services, role-based access control, and social interaction systems into a unified product.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (In practical hyperlocal retail environments, shop owners often struggle to communicate product availability, promotional events, and restocking updates to their customers in a timely manner. Similarly, customers have limited visibility into nearby store inventories, frequently making wasted trips or missing out on available offers. Wholesale suppliers face challenges in identifying retail shops that are actively seeking stock replenishment. The development of Nutonium is motivated by the need to create a centralized mobile platform that addresses these interconnected challenges within a single application.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Furthermore, the absence of structured B2B communication channels between retailers and wholesale suppliers creates supply chain delays and missed restocking opportunities. By enabling wholesalers to identify out-of- stock retailers and submit direct supply proposals, Nutonium addresses this gap and creates new revenue opportunities for small-scale suppliers. The integration of a social feed directly within the commerce interface enables organic product promotion without reliance on external advertising platforms.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (In many hyperlocal retail environments across India, shop owners operate without any digital presence, making it extremely difficult for potential customers to discover their products, check availability, or place orders remotely. Simultaneously, customers face inconveniences such as travelling to stores only to find desired products are out of stock, or missing out on promotional offers due to limited communication channels. There is therefore a clear and pressing need for a platform that connects local retailers with their customers digitally, in real time.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
