/E (Nutonium follows a service-oriented mobile architecture where the Flutter client communicates directly with Firebase services using the FlutterFire SDK. Authentication requests are routed through Firebase Authentication, which validates credentials and returns session tokens. Profile data is read from and written to Cloud Firestore using document get and set operations. Social feed content is retrieved through collection queries, with optimistic local state updates applied before server confirmation.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
