516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The results indicate that Nutonium effectively fulfils the core objectives defined in Chapter 1. The three-role architecture within a single Flutter application enables a single binary to serve diverse user groups with tailored functionality, reducing development overhead compared to separate applications per role. Firebase integration proved highly effective Authentication's multi-method support enabled different strategies per role without custom server development, and Firestore's document model mapped naturally to the project's multi-collection data requirements.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
517 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Functional Validation: Each module was validated against Chapter 1 objectives. Accurate Profile Data Entry and Retrieval confirmed through end-to-end testing. Correct Role-Based Navigation verified across all role combinations and profile states. Proper Firebase Authentication Integration confirmed for all supported sign-in methods and error conditions. Accurate Social Feed Interactions verified for load, display, filter, and optimistic update recovery.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
518 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (The social feed module demonstrates the viability of embedding community-driven discovery within a commerce application, providing value to all three user roles simultaneously. Acknowledged limitations include Cart and Map screens implemented as structured placeholders, QR scanner stubbed with informative messages, and latitude/longitude stored as placeholder zeros pending geolocation library integration. These are clearly scoped as future development work.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
519 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Role-Based Onboarding: Three-card role selection with icons, titles, and descriptions provides clear visual differentiation. Progressive Profile Forms: Organized into logical sections with clear headings and informational banners explaining each section's purpose. Multi-select FilterChip widgets for category selection provide an intuitive alternative to dropdowns. Gradient Profile Header: Combines profile photograph, display name, role badge, and contact information in a premium visual component. Responsive Design: Scrollable layouts using SingleChildScrollView and ListView widgets ensure correct display across varying screen sizes.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
520 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Fast UI Rendering via Flutter's Widget Tree: Flutter renders directly to a native canvas using its Skia/Impeller engine, resulting in consistent 60fps animations across navigation events, form interactions, and social feed scrolling. Efficient Firebase Operations: Cloud Firestore SDK implements connection pooling, request batching, and local caching, minimizing network overhead. Optimistic UI Updates: The social feed's optimistic like/unlike pattern eliminates perceived latency for interaction events, significantly improving the responsiveness of the most frequently used interactive element.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
