/E (Nutonium successfully implements a cross-platform hyperlocal social commerce mobile application designed to digitally transform offline retail ecosystems by connecting retail shop owners, wholesale suppliers, and end consumers within a unified mobile platform. In many small and medium-scale retail environments, shop owners operate without digital visibility, customers lack access to real-time inventory information, and wholesale suppliers have no efficient channel to identify retail demand. Nutonium addresses these interconnected challenges by providing a centralized mobile application where all stakeholder groups can interact, transact, and collaborate within a community-driven platform.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [11]
>>
