/Title (User Authentication: The dual authentication module successfully supports Google Sign-In for customers and Phone OTP for retailers and wholesalers. Role Selection and Onboarding: The three-role selection interface correctly routes users to role-appropriate screens with the profile completion guard enforced. Profile Management: Both Retailer and Wholesaler profile screens implement complete form validation and Firestore write operations. Social Feed: Posts load from Firestore with optimistic like interactions, search, and pull-to- refresh. Camera Module: Device camera integration works with image display and retake functionality. Navigation: Four-tab bottom navigation with context-sensitive top bar operates correctly across all tabs.)
